WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.500
[Paper rustles]

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Dinu Mamu: I can just…

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.200
Tara: Wait a moment, Mamu. Can I try again?

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.500
[Clothing shifts softly]

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.600
Dinu Mamu: All right. I’m watching.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.600
[A soft paper crease]

7
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.400
[Pencil lifts from the table]

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:43.800
[A small pencil tap]

9
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.200
Dinu Mamu: I was the one in a hurry.
